ggzf3H5KqZJ_text","label":"ggzf3H5KqZJ_text","default":"<p>Okay so here's what actually happens</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggefJAhnDRq_text","label":"ggefJAhnDRq_text","default":"<p>Week 1: Nothing. I almost gave up.</p><p>Week 2: Wait... is that different? Maybe?</p><p>Week 3: Oh. OH. Okay yes this is different.</p><p>Week 4: <i>texts best friend</i> GET THIS IMMEDIATELY.</p><p>I'm not saying it's magic. I'm saying I stopped</p><p>making my husband sleep on the couch when I felt 'off.'</p><p>Make of that what you will.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3m3MNTPVu_text","label":"gg3m3MNTPVu_text","default":"<p>-Michelle T., 47</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggsjVdNpC__text","label":"gggsjVdNpC__text","default":"<p>Plot twist: I'm the one initiating now</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdxTobAAor_text","label":"ggdxTobAAor_text","default":"<p>For two years I had every excuse in the book. Headache. Tired.</p><p>Early meeting tomorrow. My husband probably thought I'd lost interest.</p><p>Nope. Just lost my confidence.</p><p>Four weeks on FloraFresh and let's just say...</p><p>he's the one asking for a break now 😅</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggm_4XHZ8--_text","label":"ggm_4XHZ8--_text","default":"<p>-Patricia L., 39</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ6hbYet5r_text","label":"ggJ6hbYet5r_text","default":"<p>I threw away my 'just in case' underwear</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwPw2Em--R_text","label":"ggwPw2Em--R_text","default":"<p>Ladies, you know the pair. The one you keep in your purse.</p><p>The one for 'emergencies.'</p><p>Three weeks in, I realized I hadn't touched it.</p><p>That's when I knew this stuff actually works.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZa02R9sXa_text","label":"ggZa02R9sXa_text","default":"<p>- Diane M., 54</p>"}],
